  <item>
    <title>在猎头眼中 “致命”的生育空窗期，真的没有价值吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696a6514ef1cf272a7ccbeec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696a6514ef1cf272a7ccbeec</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 16:57:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这期节目中，猫三结合自身的生育经历与职业转折，探讨生育如何成为女性职业路径中的关键分水岭。她引用经济学诺奖得主 Claudia Goldin 关于女性职业结构性惩罚的研究，也引入儿童心理学对早期高质量陪伴的观点，试图拆解生育为何会在现实中演变为一副难以挣脱的职业枷锁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这不是一集提供解决方案或成功范式的播客，而是一段诚实而清醒的自我梳理：关于选择与代价，关于那些不被职场记录却真实发生的付出，以及如何在一个过于狭窄的价值体系之外，重新理解女性的人生阶段与意义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也正处在生育之后的停滞、自我怀疑或身份重塑之中，这一期，希望能让你感到被看见、被理解，也被温柔地陪伴。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a>｜猎头说“致命”，我第一次真切地觉得自己没价值了</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a>｜回到原点：我为什么会选择辞职去做试管</span></strong><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a>｜诺奖经济学得主 Claudia Goldin：生育是女性职业的分水岭</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a>｜英国社会学家Shani Orgad：连精英女性，也逃不开结构性的职业惩罚</span></strong><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a>｜美国儿童心理学家 Erica Komisar：母亲在场的价值，无法被外包</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a>｜一粒麦子的隐喻：当人生被“埋起来”的时候</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📚 本集参考学者与思想来源：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Claudia Goldin｜克劳迪娅·戈尔丁</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>哈佛大学经济学教授，2023 年诺贝尔经济学奖得主</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>研究领域</span></strong><br><span>女性劳动力参与、性别薪资差距、婚育与职业结构性不平等</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>代表著作</span></strong><br><span>Career and Family（中译常见为《事业与家庭》）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本集核心引用观点</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>当代性别收入差距并非主要来自“男女选择不同职业”，而是来自</span><strong><span>同一职业内部</span></strong><span>，对时间与可用性的不同惩罚</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>生育，是女性职业轨迹的关键分水岭</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>“贪婪工作（Greedy Work）”——</span></strong><span>那些要求随时待命、长工时、对弹性极不友好的高回报岗位，会在生育之后系统性地排斥女性</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Goldin 原文表述（英文）</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“The largest part of the gender gap today is due to the earnings gap that opens up following the birth of the first child.”</span><br><span>— </span><em><span>Career and Family</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FliixbyE_J_oHSqEtMQhYV1z4E8S.jpg"></figure><span></span><h3><strong><span>Shani Orgad｜沙尼·奥加德</span></strong><br><span></span></h3><span></span><h3><em><strong><span>伦敦政治经济学院（LSE）社会学教授</span></strong></em></h3><span></span><p><strong><span>研究领域</span></strong><br><span>性别、工作与家庭、中产与精英女性、社会叙事中的“选择幻觉”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>代表著作（中文版）</span></strong><br><span>《回归家庭？家庭、事业与难以实现的平等》（理想国·上海三联书店）</span></p><span></span><p><span>原书名：</span><em><span>Heading Home: Motherhood, Work, and the Failed Promise of Equality</span></em><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本集核心引用观点</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>即便在</span><strong><span>高学历、高收入、能负担全职保姆</span></strong><span>的中产家庭中，女性仍然大量退出高强度职业</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“生育后的退出”并非个人选择失败，而是女性被困在一个</span><strong><span>不可能完成的双重要求</span></strong><span>中：职场要求无限投入，社会却要求“密集型母职”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>所谓“你可以两者兼顾”，在现实结构中往往并不存在</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Orgad 原文表述（英文）</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“The promise that women can ‘have it all’ has become a cruel optimism.”</span><br><span>— </span><em><span>Heading Home</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtPMi2AcsdrNZBTHHPngTY0OkuCU.jpeg"></figure><span></span><h3><strong><span>Erica Komisar｜埃丽卡·科米萨尔</span></strong><br><span></span></h3><span></span><h3><em><span>儿童心理分析师、社会评论人</span></em></h3><span></span><p><strong><span>研究领域</span></strong><br><span>婴幼儿依附关系、早期情绪发展、母亲在场的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>代表著作</span></strong><br><span>Being There：</span><em><span>Why Prioritizing Motherhood in the First Three Years Matters</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本集核心引用观点</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>婴幼儿大脑在前三年主要发展的是</span><strong><span>情绪脑</span></strong><span>，需要稳定、可预测、持续的情感回应</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>母亲在这一阶段的在场，对孩子一生的安全感、情绪调节与亲密关系能力至关重要</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>这种价值</span><strong><span>无法被外包、无法被量化</span></strong><span>，却往往不被市场承认</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Komisar 原文表述（英文）</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“You can’t outsource love. And you can’t make up later for what is missed in the first three years.”</span><br><span>— </span><em><span>Being There</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr4eJ-dvv2CnHMt8WSMJa-bl9QcL.jpg"></figure><span></span><h3><strong><span>一粒麦子的隐喻</span></strong><br><span></span></h3><span></span><p><span>约翰福音 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>原文（NIV）</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“Very truly I tell you, unless a kernel of wheat falls to the ground and dies, it remains only a single seed. But if it dies, it produces many seeds.”</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>中文（和合本）</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“我实实在在地告诉你们，一粒麦子不落在地里死了，仍旧是一粒；若是死了，就结出许多子粒来。”</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：</span><strong><span>《一粒麦子》by 小羊诗歌</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b89ccb6a43241529cb7774/lnljgkrDeDdGN8WIRfmeoxOsZ1pL.m4a" length="15173687" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:15:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlOn_IJeeov9xa78hEo_nxsr1l6x.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>15 次取卵，5 次移植 ：高龄试管为何这么难！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69553d3314db1df9efd07dde</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69553d3314db1df9efd07dde</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 15:26:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这一期节目里，猫三带着一个 “笑着流泪” 的故事回归：追更三年的韩国裔博主 Hellyn，历经 15 次取卵、4 次移植失败，42 岁终于圆梦，不仅让曾经试管的她深受触动，更想把这份温暖与力量，传递给每一位正在试管路上挣扎的姐妹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集她会拆解 Hellyn 成功前的关键尝试 —— 从卵巢 PRP、DHEA，高压氧治疗到子宫内膜搔刮术、阴道益生菌，这些试管 “辅助手段” 到底是什么、适合谁、有哪些争议；更会深挖最核心的 “心态密码”：当你拼尽全力仍无法掌控结果时，如何从 “必须成功” 的执念，走向 “全然接纳” 的坦然。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 产后闭关时的意外推送：为什么这个素人博主让她追更三年？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 3年15 次取卵、5 次移植：40 岁才起步的试管之路有多难？以及成功怀孕前她尝试的6种新治疗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">08:34</a> 年龄X卵子质量：40岁因染色体异常导致的流产概率有多高？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 生化妊娠有有多常见？是你不够小心吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">12:51</a> DHEA：电商随便买的“青春素”，真的能随便吃吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>PRP：听起来完美的辅助治疗，人人都适合吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a> 子宫内膜搔刮术、HBOT（高压氧治疗）、阴道益生菌栓剂 - 这些治疗你能做吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1271">21:11</a> 试管路上，输赢都在心态，努力到极致后，悟出什么智慧？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Hellynn 的youtube channel:</span></strong><span> </span><a href="http://www.youtube.com/@hellynn_j" data-url="http://www.youtube.com/@hellynn_j"><span>www.youtube.com/@hellynn_j</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>文中提到的知识点以及文献出处：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>DHEA：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kdoWuVu8-yaueB_IkWgDgg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kdoWuVu8-yaueB_IkWgDgg"><em><span>增加卵泡数量的“神药”DHEA，吃不对会影响卵泡发育，甚至影响月经？！</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PRP：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U-DUaXZv70yL8qwj1VutVQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U-DUaXZv70yL8qwj1VutVQ"><em><span>PRP在生殖医学领域的临床应用概述</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ODrCiFSx4jfUt4QrUb1Amw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ODrCiFSx4jfUt4QrUb1Amw"><em><span>PRP作用机制 &amp; 生殖领域的临床运用&nbsp;</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>子宫内膜搜刮术：</span></strong></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35984122/" data-url="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35984122/"><em><span>Impact of endometrial scratching on reproductive outcome in patients: A systematic review and meta-analysis</span></em></a></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xWKOHuxnrAQr5ys95GY4-w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xWKOHuxnrAQr5ys95GY4-w"><em><span>移植前「内膜操作」有没有用？20年众说纷纭！重磅文献终于实锤！</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>HBOT</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10472734/" data-url="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10472734/"><em><span>Hyperbaric oxygen therapy: a possible choice for patients with resistant thin endometrium during frozen embryo transfer treatments</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.preprints.org/manuscript/202508.2044" data-url="https://www.preprints.org/manuscript/202508.2044"><em><span>Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy (HBOT) and Its Correlation with Female Infertility: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>阴道益生菌</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/318z_8nNtQvEARyFkj7WkA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/318z_8nNtQvEARyFkj7WkA"><em><span>阴道益生菌与维生素D联合补充，可能通过调节反复种植失败患者的免疫反应，从而改善妊娠结局</span></em></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b89ccb6a43241529cb7774/lshHXY0ekTrN8HSQA27gcOPML2G_.m4a" length="25950495" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlOn_IJeeov9xa78hEo_nxsr1l6x.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>生育抉择：香港 vs 内地，顺产 vs 剖腹——从执念到放下</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69437c93c4f10bdeeaff419c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69437c93c4f10bdeeaff419c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 04:13:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这一期节目里，猫三在一次次“鸽更”之后重新开麦：因为在教会遇到一对正在做试管的夫妻，听到“有人把你的播客推荐给我、每一集都认真听完、很受鼓舞”的那一刻，她突然想起——这件事的意义，不在更新频率，而在“真的能帮到一个人”的瞬间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集她会用自己的亲身经历，拆解“为什么来香港生”“怎么操作”“公立/私立和内地有什么不同”（附三家经实地考察的私立医院收费明细），以及最核心的——当顺产/剖腹的选择最终不由你掌控时（附私立医院剖腹产科普单张），如何从执念走向放下，如何在变化里“保守你的心”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a>｜八个月沉寂后回归：为什么这次又回来更新了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a>｜上期回顾：高龄+三代试管孕期“硬核知识”复盘 &amp; 本期主题预告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a>｜为什么会决定来香港生？从“优才”到“歪打正着”的人生安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a>｜高才通是什么？审批速度、条件差异、拿身份这件事到底怎么回事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a>｜“隐藏福利”：原来凭香港身份证可以在港生产、享受公立医疗待遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a>｜计划赶不上变化：决定不续签后反而顺利怀上；预产期还刚好卡在签证到期前</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a>｜香港 vs 内地：公立有多便宜？私立账单差距有多大？（含大致费用区间）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a>｜在香港生娃的“关键差异”：很多人是先选医生，再选医院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a>｜香港就医体验：公立的现实、私立的细致，以及你需要提前准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1848">30:48</a>｜顺产 vs 剖腹：你做了再多功课，最后可能仍会面对“不在计划内的结果”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">33:29</a>｜把决定交给医生，也交托给上帝：当医生明确建议剖腹产的那一刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a>｜本集最深处：生活处处有惊喜，没有什么真能掌控——你能练的，是心理素质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a>｜结尾：如何“保守你的心”——因为一生的果效由心发出</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片尾曲：</span></strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lx3FodgHElc" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lx3FodgHElc"><span>Leigh Nash "Good Trouble" with Ruby Amanfu.</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>以下是经过我实地考察过的三家香港私立医院的生产收费明细（纯属个人经验分享，绝无广告成分）：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>St. Paul's Hospital</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmseOLZJ4Emzt1QScC5q8NTYVS5C.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmIxzv2cZ2ZjIajuCecizpQbOHSR.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Canossa Hospital</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpgjgV8UoXZbPuz2H_t0L_Mx2lUF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoL7Kjyi35GDPjPJFM561O7G6bd1.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>香港中文大学医院</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft640dbiedmJDrywhAfjmV4WeKhA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>最后是St. Paul's Hospital 的剖腹产科普单张：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkgZdx6AopTUEWTBN2I2-_oN34WD.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b89ccb6a43241529cb7774/lm7QI6kgL0oDmvDpD1ZqNDrqnPcZ.m4a" length="39171519" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlOn_IJeeov9xa78hEo_nxsr1l6x.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>十月怀胎过山车，高龄试管必备的孕期干货！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6815e6406970cc7b4d7aea88</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6815e6406970cc7b4d7aea88</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 May 2025 10:04:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这一期节目中，主持人猫三经历十个月的沉寂重返播客，分享了她通过三代试管植入胚胎后，跌宕起伏的孕期经历，以及她从中学到的医学知识和人生智慧。通过帮助听众了解试管婴儿成功率的真实情况，以及高龄孕妇可能遇到的孕期挑战，她希望为正在备孕和已经怀孕的妈妈们提供科学的知识，帮助她们对抗焦虑，更加坚定信仰，不放弃希望！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a>: 三代试管成功率有多高？权威科学数据告诉你！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a>: 植入后的第一天：带着小小胚胎游台北！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a>: 两道杠和两个奇迹般的怀孕故事！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1169">19:29</a>: 孕期最大挑战：胎儿NT增厚，概率小风险高！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a>: 无创DNA以及它的局限性</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1564">26:04</a>: 三代试管（PGT-A）的局限性</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a>: 无创DNA-Plus vs. 羊水穿刺：高龄孕妇该怎么选？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2307">38:27</a>: 高龄孕妇又踩坑：妊娠高血糖病因科普！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2571">42:51</a>: 来自营养师和科学家的专业控糖小贴士：亲测有效！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2836">47:16</a>: 孕期血糖高一点，真的没关系吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3019">50:19</a>: 教你几招：如何用知识对抗焦虑</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3086">51:26</a>: 下期预告：香港生娃的利与弊 以及 剖腹产 vs. 顺产，该怎么选？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期播客提到的书籍</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkWP4R9f8PaYE6P0h4xVSAm5Bfjv.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b89ccb6a43241529cb7774/lpGD1_Rt8bNEtTN7bt5mp4D2nwfk.m4a" length="103558851" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frb8xiCVcU-PR7O6QtIibeNnWDAm.png"/>
