  <item>
    <title>原来我对“卵子质量”的认知只是冰山一角……</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6614ce085dae7932c6511609</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6614ce085dae7932c6511609</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Apr 2024 05:11:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这集主持人猫三继续发挥她那无可救药的好奇心和钻研精神，挖出了很多关于卵子发育背后的科研报告，以及如何提升卵子质量的干货知识。希望能帮助想要科学备孕的女性，更全面、系统、深入地了解自己的身体，更科学地提升卵子质量，迎接好孕！这集真的非常干，万一大脑跟不上节奏，请点击以下时间轴进行收听：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 碎片化、个体化、片面化的社交媒体内容，很容易造成备孕焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> 卵子质量具体指的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> 为什么试管取卵后的每一步都存在如此大的折损率？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 女性的卵子染色体异常概率比我们想象中要高很多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">10:32</a> 了解如何提升卵子质量的前提，是了解卵子的发育过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 卵子的染色体异常是在什么情况下发生的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 为什么卵子的能量制造机制跟卵子的染色体异常密切相关？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a> 导致卵子产能下降的线粒体损伤，是怎么发生的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">24:06</a> 为什么所有备孕营养品里面，应该优先考虑辅酶Q10？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">25:31</a> 不是所有剂型的辅酶Q10 都能被很好的吸收，那该怎么选？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1649">27:29</a> 原来褪黑素不仅助眠，还能提升卵子的抗氧化能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> α-硫辛酸也是很有效的抗氧化剂，能帮助提升卵子质量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1848">30:48</a> N-乙酰半胱氨酸，是个什么东西？跟叶酸有啥关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> DHEA， 这个你一定听过！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 都说备孕时不要给自己压力，到底压力如何影响卵子质量？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2281">38:01</a> 12点睡觉算熬夜吗？熬夜如何影响卵子质量？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a> 针灸也很有用！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 为什么我强烈推荐《好孕，从卵子开始》？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本集提到的书籍：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>《好孕，从卵子开始》- </span></strong><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E7%91%9E%E8%B4%9D%E5%8D%A1%C2%B7%E8%B4%B9%E7%89%B9" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E7%91%9E%E8%B4%9D%E5%8D%A1%C2%B7%E8%B4%B9%E7%89%B9"><span>[美] 瑞贝卡·费特</span></a><span> &nbsp;【美国各大生殖医学中心常备推荐书】【美国亚马逊 - 生育类书籍榜单 </span><strong><span>NO.1 】【</span></strong><span>北京协和医院 生殖医学中心 创始人 何方方 鼎力推荐】【北京妇产医院 原副院长 丁辉 鼎力推荐】</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgZzoHUs0bov2JobGv0YYRa3UwTW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>相关参考资料：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>油管单集：</span></strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HVkQOHiYYks" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HVkQOHiYYks"><strong><span>Egg Quality: How To Improve Your Egg Quality</span></strong></a><span> - by Natalie Crawford, MD</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>油管单集：</span></strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6WOrF6gXEzo" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6WOrF6gXEzo"><strong><span>Oogenesis and Folliculogenesis | Female Reproductive System</span></strong></a><strong><span> </span></strong><span>- by Dr Matt &amp; Dr Mike</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>科学文献：</span></strong><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7925012/#BST-49-1-107C7" data-url="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7925012/#BST-49-1-107C7"><strong><span>Aneuploidy in human eggs: contributions of the meiotic spindle</span></strong></a><strong><span> - </span></strong><span>PMC7925012</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>科学文献：</span></strong><a href="https://www.rbmojournal.com/article/S1472-6483(10)00571-7/fulltext" data-url="https://www.rbmojournal.com/article/S1472-6483(10)00571-7/fulltext"><strong><span>Meiosis errors in over 20,000 oocytes </span></strong></a><strong><span>studied in the practice of preimplantation aneuploidy testing</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>节目音乐:</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>片中曲：《Micro Love 2》</span></strong><span> 制作：猫三 via SUNO AI</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>片尾曲：《Micro Love 》</span></strong><span>制作：猫三 via SUNO AI</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnEleSl6LxpJBqGW6PvE4VbJM1Jc.m4a" length="83280326" type="audio/mp4"/>
