  <item>
    <title>冻卵：独立女性推迟生育年龄的最佳解决方案？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660295fc2d9eae5d0a23a735</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660295fc2d9eae5d0a23a735</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Mar 2024 09:31:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上一集讲完试管的十大迷思后，主持人猫三的一些朋友想深入了解“冻卵”的话题，于是猫三又收集了很多学术研究和数据，尝试通过这期来</span><u><span>帮助对“冻卵”有兴趣的姐妹们，更辩证地看待这项技术</span></u><span>，到底它是不是独立女性推迟生育年龄的最佳解决方案？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 什么是冻卵？它的流程是怎么样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="257">04:17</a> 听说冻卵存活率很低，是真的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 冻卵技术适合什么样的人群？它跟冷冻胚胎的区别是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">09:26</a> 还没准备好要孩子的已婚夫妻，为什么更适合冷冻胚胎？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> 冻卵的费用参考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> 冻卵的年龄和冷冻的卵子数量，如何影响未来的活产率？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1049">17:29</a> 中国法律禁止单身女性冻卵的三个原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1139">18:59</a> 原因一：冻卵过程存在风险；高龄孕产妇风险增加</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 原因二：冻卵可能给晚育女性带来虚假希望；冻卵成功率随年龄上升而下降</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1521">25:21</a> 原因三：担忧以盈利为目的的冻卵技术滥用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1638">27:18</a> 下期预告</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本集提到的资料</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.mdcalc.com/calc/3937/bwh-egg-freezing-counseling-tool-efct" data-url="https://www.mdcalc.com/calc/3937/bwh-egg-freezing-counseling-tool-efct"><span>哈佛医学院教授做的冻卵计算器</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.nytimes.com/2022/09/23/health/egg-freezing-age-pregnancy.html#:~:text=According%20to%20the%20Society%20for,of%20CCRM%20Fertility%20in%20Houston." data-url="https://www.nytimes.com/2022/09/23/health/egg-freezing-age-pregnancy.html#:~:text=According%20to%20the%20Society%20for,of%20CCRM%20Fertility%20in%20Houston."><span>冻卵面临的挑战 - 纽约时报2023年7月</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RKuV2G2jibA" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RKuV2G2jibA"><span>油管单集：冻卵还是冻胚胎 - Dr Lora Shahine</span></a></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>本集图文配乐Credit</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>封面：</span></strong><em><span>Illustration by Petra Eriksson for Money</span></em></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>片头曲：</span></strong><em><span>Seasons of the Jazz Ending - Created by 猫三 using SUNO AI</span></em></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>片尾曲：</span></strong><em><span>Orlando OST - Change of Sex</span></em></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltZpgRTS1J3at3LEl5DdVrWrcWKg.m4a" length="55644009" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:28:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZxZ3Bha3h4cEVKN0poVDBHak13WFl3WDlfT1MucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
