  <item>
    <title>生育真的有最佳年龄？试管十大迷思Q&amp;A</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65eea19e8e6f71a5b744cafe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65eea19e8e6f71a5b744cafe</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Mar 2024 06:15:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>相信任何现代独立女性，听到“生育最佳年龄“这个词就感到窒息，仿佛又是一种传统社会价值观对女性的洗脑，以阻碍女性继续追求事业发展和个人成长。那么没有价值倾向的生殖科学和研究数据又是怎么说的？这一集，我们通过回答10个最常见的试管迷思，试图帮助女性更深入地了解生育和年龄的关系，认识身体的潜能和有限，从而更好地规划自己的人生。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>第一集简要回顾：放弃高薪，全职试管备孕的原因</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> &nbsp;造成大众对试管治疗误解或排斥的三个原因：社会发展，媒体环境，医疗现状</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> &nbsp;什么是AMH？不同年龄的AMH参考范围</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> &nbsp;AMH的高低和怀孕难易程度的关系</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> &nbsp;卵巢储备和年龄的关系；卵巢储备和自然怀孕几率的关系</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> &nbsp;AMH能告诉我们什么，不能告诉我们什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> &nbsp;试管的取卵手术会提早消耗卵巢储备，导致提早衰老吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> &nbsp;取卵手术到底是怎样的？打麻药吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">30:34</a> &nbsp;为什么年龄越大，卵子质量越差？卵子质量对试管治疗的影响</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2448">40:48</a> &nbsp;卵子质量如何影响胚胎质量和试管成功率</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2689">44:49</a> &nbsp;女性对生育知识的掌握程度会如何影响她一生的决定</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">46:05</a> &nbsp;什么是三代试管？为什么医生建议年纪大的夫妻做三代？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3081">51:21</a> &nbsp;试管到底是不是违背自然？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3418">56:58</a> &nbsp;免责声明和下期预告</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>想了解更多试管和生育方面的科学知识，可自行查阅以下资料:</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>播客</span></strong><span> “As A Woman” by Dr. Natalie Crawford.</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>油管频道</span></strong><span> </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@NatalieCrawfordMD" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@NatalieCrawfordMD"><span>Natalie Crawford, MD</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>油管单集：</span></strong><span>Andrew Huberman X Dr. Natalie Crawford: </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhlIkzJwPlk&amp;t=7870s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhlIkzJwPlk&amp;t=7870s"><span>Female Hormone Health, Fertility &amp; Vitality</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>油管频道：</span></strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@drlorashahine" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@drlorashahine"><span>Dr Lora Shahine</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>油管单集：</span></strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y_TR2UDnxqg" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y_TR2UDnxqg"><span>Oogenesis and Spermatogenesis | Reproductive</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>油管单集：</span></strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YE-a7XiEYB4&amp;t=10s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YE-a7XiEYB4&amp;t=10s"><span>Gonadotropins | Follicle Stimulating Hormone (FSH) and Luteinizing Hormone (LH)</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>微信公众号：</span></strong><span>生殖圈</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本集音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>片中曲：</span></strong><span>"Our Journey to Parenthood" by 猫三 using SUNO AI</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>片尾曲：</span></strong><span>Wonderfully Made // Ellie Holcomb feat. Spoken Word Artist Gloria Umanah</span></blockquote>]]></description>
